{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Do not close the timeline for suspended executions**\n\n`ON_CHANGE` emits here for PENDING/RETRYING too, so every RUNNING suspension record gets an `endTime` and duration ending at the invocation boundary. Consumers can consequently interpret an active workflow as ended. Supply an end time only for terminal statuses and test that PENDING/RETRYING omit both timeline fields.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7sNyWR","finding_digest":"9d41940da5f7ab624cd6a9018d2ba35a89194805d1b7819b0890cec7e537feb8","finding_id":"arf_v1_tvazidnf66vwetgwveay2k5dlk","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.oninvocationend::nonterminal-end-time-omission","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.oninvocationend::nonterminal-end-time-omission","line":192,"observation_digest":"660f5c074e647c6c56a59e831865a9d0d8419b9631b5effd981623c87aac1606","observation_id":"aro_v1_myhvyb2omr6gyvvft2brqznj2d","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-08T23:03:33Z","review_id":"arr_v1_iee7bcnfj7lcytdfodx5mvljjs","reviewed_base_sha":"730f534832656d1da8a3205f5468595ffb05f33d","reviewed_head_sha":"ce1de5fa37a2da2f6805802585eeee8390944531","reviewer":"codex","start_line":192,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_ssi3axua3b5hbra3wx7sk5tdry"},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_elzmb4p65jgtjxbef5rd334o4g","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-08T23:03:33Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
